{"segs": ["ZH_T20_1055_001:0071a19_0"], "en": "The Holy Praise of the Bodhisattva Avalokiteśvara Spoken by the Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T15:40:14Z"},
